# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# YatraSetu — Environment Variables
# Fill in your API keys below. App works without them (fallback data).
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ─── Supabase (Auth + Database) ───
# Get from: https://supabase.com → Project Settings → API
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR_PROJECT_ID.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key-here
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=your-service-role-key-here

# ─── Google (Maps + Places) ───
# Get from: https://console.cloud.google.com → APIs & Services → Credentials
# Enable: Maps JavaScript API, Places API, Distance Matrix API
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your-google-maps-key
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY=your-google-places-key

# ─── Weather ───
# Get from: https://openweathermap.org/api (free tier is fine)
OPENWEATHERMAP_API_KEY=your-openweathermap-key

# ─── Google OAuth (configured in Supabase Dashboard, not here) ───
# Steps:
# 1. Go to Google Cloud Console → Credentials → Create OAuth 2.0 Client ID
# 2. Set redirect URI to: https://YOUR_PROJECT_ID.supabase.co/auth/v1/callback
# 3. Copy Client ID + Secret into Supabase Dashboard → Auth → Providers → Google
# You do NOT need to put OAuth keys in this file.

# ─── SMS Provider (configured in Supabase Dashboard, not here) ───
# Option A: MSG91 (India — cheapest)
#   - Sign up at https://msg91.com → get Auth Key
#   - Supabase Dashboard → Auth → Providers → Phone → enter MSG91 details
#
# Option B: Twilio Verify (global)
#   - Sign up at https://twilio.com → get Account SID + Auth Token
#   - Create Verify Service → get Service SID
#   - Supabase Dashboard → Auth → Providers → Phone → enter Twilio details
#
# These keys go in Supabase dashboard, NOT in this file.
